// EASCape: Master Farmers had a Pickpocket option and no loot. Void's master_farmer stats
// (data/skill/thieving/thieving.tables.toml: level 38, 43 xp, 8 stun ticks, 3 damage, 90-240).
// Seeds: the OSRS wiki's table (Master Farmer, weights = 1,000,000 / its 1-in-X), without what came
// after 2006: snape grass and potato cactus seeds (not in our 2006 cache), seaweed spores (16 Sep
// 2020) and Rocky; the four herb seeds that scale with Farming since 24 Mar 2021 (guam, ranarr,
// snapdragon, torstol) use the flat rates from before, as in Void's table. One seed per pick, out of
// the total left once those are gone.
[pickpocket_master_farmer]
